.TH CAMERA_TO_WORLD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_to_world \- Convert a screen position (e.g. the mouse, v2(in\->mouse_x, in\->mouse_y)) to world coordinates: the inverse of camera_to_screen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 camera_to_world(const Camera *c, Vec2 screen);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert a screen position (e.g. the mouse, v2(in\->mouse_x, in\->mouse_y)) to world coordinates: the inverse of camera_to_screen. Divide by the tile size to get the tile under the cursor.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the position in world units.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_to_screen (3),
.BR Input (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
